Incorrect. All weapons in Slashem (and nethack) can be safely enchanted
(zero chance of vaporization) while at +5 or lower.  Elven weapons are
not special at all in this regard.

The Elven "enchant up to +7 and then polymorph/upgrade" refers to
ARMOR.

You will not be able to lift a stack of daggers bigger than about 200,
BTW.

In slashem, the limits in shopkeeper enchantment are:
(from http://www.statslab.cam.ac.uk/~eva/slashem/services.html )
Shopkeepers cannot enchant weapons beyond +5
and
Shopkeepers cannot enchant armour beyond +3



